    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1166-a1">

                <pb facs="1052" n="738" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg738"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé d’Affaires in
                        Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>)</head>

                <opener>
                    <dateline>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 15, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your August 13. Since you have protested both orally and in writing against the
                    arrest and imprisonment of German and Austrian consuls in Russia, the Department
                    is of opinion that you should do nothing more at the present time.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
